      "question": "How does the jury find the defendant?",
      "quote": "That's eleven guilty. Somebody's got a reasonable doubt?",
      "rationale": "Eleven of twelve jurors voted guilty on the first ballot. The knife matches the defendant's own description of a rare weapon, the downstairs neighbor testified he heard the defendant threaten to kill his father and then heard the body fall, and the woman across the street said she saw the stabbing through the windows of a passing elevated train.",
