      "question": null,
      "quote": null,
      "rationale": "A second knife identical to the one in evidence turned up two blocks from the apartment, undercutting the claim it was one of a kind. The re-enactment showed the upstairs witness could not have reached his door in time to see what he described. And the only eyewitness needed glasses she was not wearing in bed. None of this proves innocence, but it is enough reasonable doubt that all twelve of us can no longer say guilty beyond it.",
